Comment: 50,0:00:17.00,0:00:17.04,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,Cold Open
Comment: 50,0:01:59.02,0:01:59.06,Default,chptr,0,0,0,opsync,OP
Comment: 50,0:03:29.98,0:03:30.02,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,Part A
Comment: 50,0:14:48.99,0:14:49.03,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,Part B
