Comment: 50,0:23:52.99,0:23:53.04,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,Preview
Dialogue: 50,0:00:22.21,0:00:23.09,Default,Maria,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:23.09,0:00:24.30,Default,Maria,0,0,0,,Shio!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:24.30,0:00:26.09,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Good to see you again.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:26.92,0:00:28.42,Default,Maria,0,0,0,,The usual?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:28.42,0:00:29.47,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Yes, please.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:30.47,0:00:31.47,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:31.89,0:00:33.22,Default,Maria,0,0,0,,Are you doing well?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:33.22,0:00:34.43,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:34.43,0:00:38.85,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,We finished our new spring product,\Nso I wanted you to try it.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:38.85,0:00:39.73,Default,Maria,0,0,0,,Sweet!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:41.02,0:00:43.98,Default,Maria,0,0,0,,Wow, so pretty!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:43.98,0:00:46.86,Default,Maria,0,0,0,,I'm going right in!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:48.95,0:00:51.20,Default,Maria,0,0,0,,Delicious!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:51.20,0:00:55.99,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,You made that same face when\Nyou first tried my parfait way back then.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:56.45,0:01:01.25,Default,Maria,0,0,0,,That's because I had never tried\Na parfait until I came here.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:01.83,0:01:04.17,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Did you move here from far away?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:04.17,0:01:05.21,Default,Maria,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:05.21,0:01:07.09,Default,Maria,0,0,0,,Very, very far away.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:09.55,0:01:12.76,Default,Maria,0,0,0,,Anyways, Fuu's grown very big, hasn't she?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:12.76,0:01:15.18,Default,Maria,0,0,0,,She came here on an errand recently.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:15.72,0:01:21.19,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,That's just it. Fuu and Rui both suddenly\Nstarted acting so mature.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:21.19,0:01:24.23,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,They've been coming home late.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:24.23,0:01:26.61,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,I'm a bit worried about them.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:28.53,0:01:30.61,Default,Maria,0,0,0,,They have their reasons, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:31.20,0:01:33.66,Default,Maria,0,0,0,,But knowing them, they'll be just fine.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:34.53,0:01:39.20,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,If you say so. You say strange things\Nsometimes, but you're usually right.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:44.13,0:01:46.04,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Thank you for the coffee!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:46.04,0:01:47.75,Default,Maria,0,0,0,,Come again anytime!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:50.51,0:01:52.01,Default,Creature 1,0,0,0,,Brr, so chilly.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:52.01,0:01:54.76,Default,Creature 2,0,0,0,,This cold is starting to get annoying.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:54.76,0:01:56.14,Default,Creature 3,0,0,0,,Let's get inside.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:56.64,0:01:59.02,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,What strange-looking customers.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:34.99,0:03:39.66,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,About the Festival of Magic,\Nthere's something important we're still not set on.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:39.66,0:03:42.12,Default,Creature 1,0,0,0,,We picked out the venue before, no?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:42.12,0:03:46.41,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,Yeah, but we haven't found\Nthe festival's songstress yet.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:47.50,0:03:49.33,Default,Creature 2,0,0,0,,What?! That's terrible!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:49.33,0:03:52.17,Default,Creature 1,0,0,0,,We can't hold the ceremony\Nwithout a songstress.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:52.17,0:03:54.59,Default,Maria,0,0,0,,Hello, thank you for waiting!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:55.01,0:03:57.05,Default,Maria,0,0,0,,Here's your lunch set.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:57.05,0:03:58.09,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:58.47,0:04:00.85,Default,Creature 2,0,0,0,,Let's figure it out over our food.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:00.85,0:04:02.10,Default,Creature 1,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:02.10,0:04:04.85,Default,Creature 1,0,0,0,,So this is the red fire dog?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:08.64,0:04:13.65,Default,Creature 2,0,0,0,,By the way, Maria, who was that girl\NI met here the other day?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:13.94,0:04:15.03,Default,Maria,0,0,0,,Lulu?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:15.03,0:04:19.28,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,Right! Meeter mentioned she was\Na popular idol around these parts.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:19.28,0:04:21.49,Default,Creature 1,0,0,0,,I'm a huge fan too!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:21.49,0:04:22.66,Default,Creature 2,0,0,0,,Same here!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:23.16,0:04:24.16,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:24.16,0:04:26.54,Default,Maria,0,0,0,,Don't talk with your mouth full.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:26.54,0:04:29.71,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,Do you suppose we could recommend\Nher as a candidate?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:29.71,0:04:30.46,Default,Maria,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:30.92,0:04:34.92,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,A magical idol might make her a perfect fit!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:36.01,0:04:37.26,Default,Maria,0,0,0,,{\i1}As songstress?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:38.42,0:04:41.18,Default,Maria,0,0,0,,{\i1}Being the songstress for the Festival of Magic...
Dialogue: 50,0:04:41.18,0:04:45.01,Default,Maria,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's no greater honor in the magical land.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:45.01,0:04:46.68,Default,Maria,0,0,0,,{\i1}But...
Dialogue: 50,0:04:47.27,0:04:48.89,Default,Maria,0,0,0,,I don't know...
Dialogue: 50,0:04:49.56,0:04:52.36,Default,Maria,0,0,0,,I can ask my other customers, if you'd like.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:52.36,0:04:53.82,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,I'd appreciate it!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:53.82,0:04:55.98,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,Thanks for the food!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:55.98,0:04:58.95,Default,Maria,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have to protect those children.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:58.95,0:05:00.49,Default,Maria,0,0,0,,{\i1}For Shio.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:03.24,0:05:05.08,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Lilly-san and Fuu...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:05.95,0:05:08.00,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Transforming with magic.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:09.87,0:05:14.96,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I tried investigating Fuu, but nothing was off.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:14.96,0:05:19.92,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,And I still don't know about that song,\Neven after using magic.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:21.34,0:05:23.26,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Hey, Azuki.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:23.97,0:05:26.06,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Are you sure you don't know anything?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:26.97,0:05:28.85,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,I don't!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:28.85,0:05:29.60,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:30.31,0:05:34.56,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Fuu really is a lot like Lilly-san.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:34.56,0:05:38.78,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,The way they're both clumsy,\Nand how they both love milk.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:38.78,0:05:41.49,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,I love milk too!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:42.86,0:05:44.87,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Maybe it's a coincidence.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:46.53,0:05:48.95,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I need to find another way to investigate!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:48.95,0:05:50.00,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Oh boy...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:51.58,0:05:53.21,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Should be in here.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:53.21,0:05:54.33,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Found it!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:54.83,0:05:56.38,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:56.38,0:05:59.34,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,A crystal ball. It's used for fortune-telling.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:59.71,0:06:02.59,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,You can look in it to see the truth.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:06.55,0:06:08.51,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}I think the coast is clear.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:10.64,0:06:15.27,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,If I use magic on the crystal ball,\NI might be able to figure something out.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:16.56,0:06:17.40,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Letto!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:33.75,0:06:36.92,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Lululila pululila,
Dialogue: 50,0:06:36.92,0:06:39.42,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,pop'n pam!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:14.08,0:07:16.75,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Tell me more about magic.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:21.17,0:07:23.92,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Huh? I don't see anything.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:31.22,0:07:32.93,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:33.93,0:07:35.23,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,This, please!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:35.23,0:07:37.73,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,We appreciate your continued support!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:39.40,0:07:40.98,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Is this a gift?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:40.98,0:07:42.36,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Yep, yep.{she ですですs in the last ep too i went with just one "yep" there but i'll prob change it retroactively now that it's more of a catchphrase}
Dialogue: 50,0:07:44.19,0:07:46.07,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming in!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:49.74,0:07:51.33,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:51.33,0:07:52.41,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Welcome back, Fuu.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:52.74,0:07:54.58,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,What's for dinner?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:55.75,0:07:56.58,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Curry.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:56.58,0:07:59.83,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Yay! I'll get the meat!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:03.30,0:08:05.67,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,What is this...?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:05.67,0:08:08.13,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,It looks like a view of somewhere.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:08.47,0:08:11.14,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,That's Felix Star!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:11.14,0:08:12.97,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,The magical land?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:14.35,0:08:16.85,Default,Ru,0,0,0,,The spell was cast on my mirror!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:17.77,0:08:20.56,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I might be able to find something with this.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:21.27,0:08:24.32,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I can figure out Fuu's secret.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:28.57,0:08:29.57,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Big sis!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:29.99,0:08:31.53,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Dinner's ready!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:31.53,0:08:32.99,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,O-Okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:32.99,0:08:34.58,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I have to de-transform!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:34.58,0:08:36.08,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Be careful!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:38.08,0:08:40.42,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I'll look into this later.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:45.09,0:08:46.76,Default,All,0,0,0,,Thank you for the food.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:49.63,0:08:52.09,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,The curry's so spicy!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:52.09,0:08:53.60,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Huh, is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:53.97,0:08:57.31,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,I tried making it from roux,\Ndid that make it too spicy?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:57.31,0:08:59.94,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,So spicy!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:04.86,0:09:06.48,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Dad, how could you?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:06.48,0:09:08.57,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Huh? Sorry...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:09.53,0:09:10.78,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Rui?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:11.70,0:09:12.95,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Big sis?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:14.70,0:09:16.49,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,D-Do you want more milk?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:16.49,0:09:18.54,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Hm? Sure!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:18.54,0:09:21.12,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,You're very considerate.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:21.12,0:09:24.00,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,P-Please, I'm not.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:26.30,0:09:27.51,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:27.51,0:09:30.01,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,What's gotten into you, Rui?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:30.01,0:09:31.47,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,You're acting strange.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:31.47,0:09:33.34,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,N-No I'm not.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:33.34,0:09:37.97,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I was just thinking that\NI have a long way to go.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:37.97,0:09:40.43,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Did you mistake me for someone else?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:40.43,0:09:44.86,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I did that at school today.\NI accidentally called my teacher Mom!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:44.86,0:09:46.69,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,It was so embarrassing.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:47.15,0:09:48.44,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Did you?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:49.36,0:09:50.95,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I see!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:53.61,0:09:55.78,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Did you put something in the curry?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:55.78,0:09:59.79,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Nothing out of the ordinary,\Njust some special spices.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:59.79,0:10:01.75,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Make it sweeter, okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:03.79,0:10:05.63,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,{\an8}I got it.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:05.63,0:10:07.46,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,{\an8}This is really spicy!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:07.46,0:10:09.30,Default,Dad/Mom,0,0,0,,{\an8}– Is it really?\N– It definitely is.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:04.71,0:10:07.46,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fuu sure smiles a lot.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:12.30,0:10:16.47,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,On today's Once More livestream,\Nwe'll be introducing Asahi to the fans!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:16.80,0:10:18.72,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Already?!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:18.72,0:10:20.85,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:20.85,0:10:23.52,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Lilly and Lulu debuted much quicker than this.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:23.52,0:10:24.44,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Did we?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:24.44,0:10:26.90,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Umm, yes, we did.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:26.90,0:10:30.36,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Well, if you want me to, I will.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:31.65,0:10:33.90,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Then let's get ready!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:33.90,0:10:34.91,Default,All,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:34.91,0:10:35.91,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:40.29,0:10:41.75,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Can you set up the camera?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:41.75,0:10:43.46,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:43.46,0:10:44.79,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Hey, Asahi-chan.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:45.17,0:10:46.17,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:48.42,0:10:50.05,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I gotcha!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:48.79,0:10:51.67,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,{\an8}Stop it!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:50.59,0:10:52.51,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,What is she, in elementary school?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:52.51,0:10:54.68,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Come on, Lilly-san...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:54.68,0:10:56.14,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Sorry, sorry.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:57.05,0:10:59.01,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Your hair's sticking up.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:59.72,0:11:01.72,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Stay still, I'll fix it.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:03.18,0:11:05.14,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Since people will be watching.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:06.40,0:11:07.19,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Asahi?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:07.19,0:11:09.65,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Aah, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:09.65,0:11:11.82,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,There, you're all good.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:11.82,0:11:13.65,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:14.70,0:11:15.91,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,You've got this!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:15.91,0:11:18.07,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Huh?! Umm, yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:18.07,0:11:19.41,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Let's have some fun!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:19.41,0:11:21.24,Default,Asai,0,0,0,,O-Okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:22.91,0:11:24.16,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:24.16,0:11:25.66,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,We're about to start!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:26.67,0:11:31.17,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Hello! It's time for the Once More livestream!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:31.17,0:11:32.67,Default,All,0,0,0,,We're starting!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:33.21,0:11:37.34,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Today, we have a very important announcement.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:37.34,0:11:39.93,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,You'll never believe it.\NProduction Once More...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:39.93,0:11:42.97,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,has a brand new member!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:42.97,0:11:45.18,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Allow us to introduce you to her!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:47.52,0:11:49.19,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Hello there, everyone!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:49.56,0:11:52.82,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Dig here, wan-wan! Once More!{kokohore wanwan comes from the folk tale hanasaka jiisan}
Dialogue: 50,0:11:52.82,0:11:56.07,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,I'll dig my way into your heart!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:59.28,0:12:03.74,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,I'm Production Once More's secret weapon, Araki Asahi!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:03.74,0:12:05.87,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:06.25,0:12:09.29,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,What was that? It was so cute!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:10.71,0:12:13.80,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,I came up with it! It's my idol greeting!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:13.80,0:12:18.05,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,"Dig here, wan-wan! Once More!" Like that?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:18.05,0:12:20.43,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Yep, yep! Good job!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:20.43,0:12:22.05,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:22.55,0:12:25.52,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,She's a whole different person\Nin front of the camera.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:25.52,0:12:27.06,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I'm shocked too.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:27.06,0:12:29.27,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Oh, we've got some comments.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:29.27,0:12:32.69,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,"Her greeting is so cute!"\N"Dig here, wan-wan!"
Dialogue: 50,0:12:32.69,0:12:34.57,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:34.57,0:12:38.15,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,"I want to know more about Asahi!"\N"What is your favorite thing?"
Dialogue: 50,0:12:38.15,0:12:40.91,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Thank you for all the comments!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:41.41,0:12:43.83,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,My favorite thing is...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:43.83,0:12:45.41,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Let me think.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:45.41,0:12:47.87,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,My favorite thing is...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:47.87,0:12:49.87,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,bean daifuku!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:49.87,0:12:51.17,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:51.17,0:12:54.13,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,You like confectioneries?\NSo do I!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:54.13,0:12:55.38,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,You too, Lulu-san?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:55.38,0:12:56.80,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Talk about sophisticated.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:56.80,0:12:58.76,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Cool!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:58.76,0:13:01.05,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Now, say your closing words!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:02.26,0:13:06.22,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,I'll do my best to leave an impression going forward,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:06.97,0:13:08.98,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,so please look forward to it!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:09.31,0:13:14.23,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,That concludes the introduction\Nof our new member! Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:14.23,0:13:15.98,Default,All,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:14.23,0:13:15.98,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,{\an8}Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:20.24,0:13:23.12,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,We got a lot of comments today!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:23.82,0:13:25.95,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,All thanks to Asahi.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:25.95,0:13:26.95,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:26.95,0:13:32.21,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Asahi-chan, you turned into a totally different\Nperson when we went live! I didn't see it coming.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:32.21,0:13:33.83,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Oh, please.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:34.92,0:13:36.84,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Ah, you're back to normal.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:36.84,0:13:38.84,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,What a quick switch.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:38.84,0:13:40.30,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,It's amazing.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:40.30,0:13:43.84,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I knew you had real potential, Asahi!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:45.55,0:13:48.31,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,You won them over with your catchy greeting.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:48.85,0:13:50.52,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,You get full points!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:52.44,0:13:53.81,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,But matter of fact...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:54.27,0:13:57.57,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,it's got nothing on the cheer we have, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:59.49,0:14:00.65,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:02.15,0:14:04.28,Default,All,0,0,0,,Once...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:04.87,0:14:08.45,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Oh, you're done. I've got lunch.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:08.45,0:14:11.12,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,I just bought whatever, so share it with each other.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:11.54,0:14:14.21,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Man, bad timing!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:14.21,0:14:15.00,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:17.34,0:14:19.34,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,I always get this. It's great.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:19.67,0:14:21.05,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,There's some on your face.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:24.84,0:14:28.81,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lulu-chan, Asahi-chan's interesting, isn't she?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:29.31,0:14:31.35,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, she is!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:31.35,0:14:33.73,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I think things are about to get even more fun!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:37.77,0:14:40.15,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,This curry bread's very sweet!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:43.57,0:14:45.61,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}It really is Fuu.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:46.32,0:14:47.28,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}Right?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:53.50,0:14:54.87,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I'm done with my bath.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:54.87,0:14:56.00,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:56.00,0:14:58.59,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I'm going to bed. Good night.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:58.59,0:15:00.38,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Good night, Rui!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:05.97,0:15:08.89,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,The spell's still working.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:16.19,0:15:17.65,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:17.65,0:15:22.65,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Now that I finally have the time,\NI think I'll look into this.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:24.19,0:15:26.20,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,What is it showing me?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:29.41,0:15:32.29,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Is this the magical land?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:32.29,0:15:35.46,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Yes, it's our home!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:35.91,0:15:37.17,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:37.71,0:15:41.96,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,So this is where my magic comes from.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:44.38,0:15:46.55,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Lululila pululila,
Dialogue: 50,0:15:46.55,0:15:48.59,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,show me other places.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:01.82,0:16:03.82,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Bring me in closer.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:07.15,0:16:08.82,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Shops?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:11.83,0:16:13.62,Default,Bear,0,0,0,,Can I have this please?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:13.62,0:16:15.33,Default,Dinosaur,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:15.33,0:16:17.50,Default,Hedgehog,0,0,0,,Yeah, I win!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:19.88,0:16:23.30,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,The magical land is so strange!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:23.30,0:16:24.59,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Rui!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:25.09,0:16:27.84,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I know. Just a bit longer.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:28.55,0:16:30.26,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Show me more.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:43.52,0:16:44.90,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,So pretty.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:46.11,0:16:50.53,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Azuki, didn't I wish for it\Nto teach me more about magic?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:50.53,0:16:51.11,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:51.49,0:16:55.91,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,If I keep watching,\Nmaybe I'll learn the secret of magic.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:58.04,0:16:58.91,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:59.96,0:17:01.25,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,That person...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:02.42,0:17:04.00,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,where are they going?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:22.02,0:17:24.23,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,They look like they're building something.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:25.19,0:17:26.73,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Where did they go?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:27.28,0:17:28.07,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:28.07,0:17:29.74,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,How is the stage coming along?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:29.74,0:17:32.03,Default,Dog,0,0,0,,We don't have enough stone for the base.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:32.49,0:17:34.07,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,Can you substitute it?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:34.07,0:17:38.29,Default,Dog,0,0,0,,The stage is very important,\Nso we have to use the right materials.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:38.29,0:17:40.04,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:40.04,0:17:42.62,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,Alright, I'll procure it.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:42.62,0:17:44.71,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,That person really is...!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:49.72,0:17:52.97,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,The guy I showed the way to Café Dubdub!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:54.14,0:17:56.01,Default,Gatekeeper,0,0,0,,'Sup, Oleans!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:56.01,0:17:58.64,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,Yo. Wanted to talk about something.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:59.06,0:18:00.27,Default,Gatekeeper,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:00.27,0:18:04.56,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,I was looking into the girl who came here before.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:04.56,0:18:05.69,Default,Gatekeeper,0,0,0,,Oh-ho?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:06.06,0:18:09.78,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,From what I heard,\Nshe's working as a magical idol,
Dialogue: 50,0:18:09.78,0:18:12.57,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,and was brought here by the Smoky Gentleman.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:12.57,0:18:17.28,Default,Gatekeeper,0,0,0,,Oh, I remember! She was very chipper.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:17.28,0:18:18.95,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,Do you know where she's from?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:18.95,0:18:21.20,Default,Gatekeeper,0,0,0,,Hmm, I don't.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:21.66,0:18:24.17,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,A magical idol?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:24.17,0:18:25.46,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Does he mean...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:25.75,0:18:28.46,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,If you figure anything out, just let me know!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:28.46,0:18:30.21,Default,Gatekeeper,0,0,0,,Are you going for a climb?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:30.21,0:18:31.97,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,Nah, not today.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:31.97,0:18:33.22,Default,Gatekeeper,0,0,0,,Oh, okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:36.01,0:18:37.60,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,A castle!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:37.97,0:18:41.85,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,It's the magical castle, Felix Tower.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:43.10,0:18:45.60,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,I have an appointment in the librarian's office.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:45.60,0:18:46.90,Default,Guard,0,0,0,,You may pass.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:08.46,0:19:09.96,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,Yo, Mucchi!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:17.22,0:19:18.72,Default,Mucchi,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, Oleans.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:19.18,0:19:21.68,Default,Mucchi,0,0,0,,Have you found a songstress yet?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:21.68,0:19:24.48,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,Nope, haven't had any luck with that.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:24.48,0:19:26.44,Default,Mucchi,0,0,0,,I see this is posing a difficulty.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:26.44,0:19:27.98,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,Certainly is for me.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:27.98,0:19:31.98,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,But I think we could look for\Na candidate in the human world!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:33.78,0:19:35.86,Default,Mucchi,0,0,0,,Do you have any hits?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:36.61,0:19:39.91,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,I figured the girl I met before would do!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:39.91,0:19:44.71,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,But there's one more: an idol\Nbeloved even here in the magical land!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:44.71,0:19:45.83,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,An idol?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:46.83,0:19:50.84,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,I'm still trying to find info on her,\Nbut what do you think?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:51.59,0:19:54.80,Default,Mucchi,0,0,0,,The Festival of Magic is sacred.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:54.80,0:19:57.88,Default,Mucchi,0,0,0,,The songstress has to be on par.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:57.88,0:20:00.35,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,That's no problem.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:00.35,0:20:03.39,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,Both of them have magic powers!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:03.89,0:20:05.14,Default,Mucchi,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:05.85,0:20:09.40,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,I took another look through the old books.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:09.81,0:20:16.40,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,The Festival of Magic serves to tune\Nthe balance of magic in Felix Star.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:16.90,0:20:20.62,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,That will bring blessings and prosperity to the world.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:21.87,0:20:27.75,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,And at the heart of the festival's ceremony\Nis the songstress's performance.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:29.00,0:20:33.92,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,Her singing will make the magic hourglass move,
Dialogue: 50,0:20:36.97,0:20:41.39,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,thus rotating the magic in our world.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:41.76,0:20:48.27,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,Because of that, it's important the singer\Nhas magic in their voice.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:51.31,0:20:57.40,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,So, as long as they have magic powers,\Nhumans can qualify for the songstress too!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:58.28,0:20:59.74,Default,Mucchi,0,0,0,,That checks out.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:00.74,0:21:04.74,Default,Mucchi,0,0,0,,The festival's songstress is the embodiment\Nof this world's hope.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:04.74,0:21:07.45,Default,Mucchi,0,0,0,,If that is a human, so be it.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:07.87,0:21:11.12,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,But magic has to stay a secret.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:11.12,0:21:14.21,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,If other humans find out about it,\Nit'll spell trouble.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:14.54,0:21:19.26,Default,Mucchi,0,0,0,,I wouldn't worry about it.\NIf anyone finds out,
Dialogue: 50,0:21:19.26,0:21:22.47,Default,Mucchi,0,0,0,,they'll just be trapped in the prison of souls.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:25.43,0:21:31.27,Default,Mucchi,0,0,0,,They'll disappear from people's memories\Nand spend the rest of eternity in there.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:32.73,0:21:35.90,Default,Mucchi,0,0,0,,It'd be far easier on us that way.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:36.40,0:21:38.78,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,But it'd stink for them, wouldn't it?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:38.78,0:21:41.99,Default,Mucchi,0,0,0,,Seriously? It was your suggestion.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:43.70,0:21:47.74,Default,Mucchi,0,0,0,,I have a lot to get to, so that'll be all.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:52.58,0:21:56.63,Default,Mucchi,0,0,0,,Now that my worries are gone,\NI look forward to the festival.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:03.22,0:22:04.64,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Rui...
Dialogue: 50,0:22:06.39,0:22:07.76,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,The songstress...
Dialogue: 50,0:22:09.10,0:22:11.39,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,They're going to take Fuu away?
Comment: 50,0:00:17.00,0:00:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Café Dubdub
Comment: 50,0:01:41.83,0:01:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Café Dubdub
Comment: 50,0:03:29.98,0:03:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The Magic Songstress
Comment: 50,0:07:32.93,0:07:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Bean daifuku
Comment: 50,0:07:43.28,0:07:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Furyu Confectionaries
Comment: 50,0:10:12.30,0:10:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Newbie Debut! Cute & Amazing
Comment: 50,0:11:27.79,0:11:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Production Once More
Comment: 50,0:12:29.27,0:12:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Her greeting is so cute! / Dig here, wan-wan! / I love her!!
Comment: 50,0:12:33.77,0:12:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Her smile is so lovely! / I want to know more about Asahi! / What is your favorite thing? / You're dazzling!
Comment: 50,0:14:15.58,0:14:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Salmon-flavored
Comment: 50,0:23:52.99,0:23:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Rui's Seven Transformations
Comment: 0,0:00:17.00,0:00:20.00,Signs,,0,0,0,,Café Dubdub
