Dialogue: 1,0:02:16.00,0:02:17.87,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Let's blow it all away{蹴散らしてゆこう}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:18.88,0:02:21.21,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}My daily routine's getting boring{退屈な日常}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.21,0:02:24.80,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}But when I met you it started swingin'{キミと出会った瞬間Swingin'}
