Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.02,0:02:44.15,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Don't leave me{話さないで}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.15,0:02:46.95,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Swingin' magic
